{"b":"Ps","c":20,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"The LORD hear thee in the day of trouble; the name of the God of Jacob defend thee;","x":[["Prov.18.10",22,"r"],["Ps.138.7",18,"w"],["Ps.91.14",17,"r"],["Ps.91.15",17,"w"],["Matt.26.38",15,"r"],["Matt.26.39",15,"r"],["Ps.46.11",14,"e"],["Heb.5.7",14,"r"],["Isa.50.10",14,"e"],["Ps.83.18",13,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"Send thee help from the sanctuary, and strengthen thee out of Zion;","x":[["1Kgs.8.44",5,"w"],["1Kgs.8.45",5,"r"],["1Kgs.6.16",4,"r"],["2Chr.20.8",3,"w"],["2Chr.20.9",3,"w"],["Isa.12.6",3,"w"],["Isa.14.32",3,"w"],["Ps.3.4",2,"r"],["2Sam.5.7",2,"w"],["Ps.73.17",2,"w"]]},{"n":3,"t":"Remember all thy offerings, and accept thy burnt sacrifice; Selah.","x":[["Ps.51.19",4,"w"],["2Chr.7.1",3,"w"],["Acts.10.4",3,"r"],["Gen.4.4",3,"r"],["1Chr.21.26",2,"w"],["1Pet.2.5",2,"r"],["Eph.5.2",2,"w"],["Isa.60.7",2,"r"],["Lev.9.24",1,"w"]]},{"n":4,"t":"Grant thee according to thine own heart, and fulfil all thy counsel.","x":[["Ps.37.4",26,"r"],["Ps.145.19",25,"w"],["Ps.21.2",19,"r"],["Matt.21.22",19,"r"],["Prov.11.23",15,"r"],["John.16.23",15,"r"],["Rom.8.27",12,"r"],["Rom.8.28",12,"r"],["1John.5.14",11,"r"],["1John.5.15",11,"r"]]},{"n":5,"t":"We will rejoice in thy salvation, and in the name of our God we will set up our banners: the LORD fulfil all thy petitions.","it":[[76,79]],"x":[["Exod.17.15",13,"r"],["Ps.60.4",11,"r"],["1Sam.1.17",10,"r"],["Isa.25.9",5,"e"],["Isa.12.1",5,"r"],["Isa.12.3",5,"w"],["Luke.1.47",5,"r"],["Isa.61.10",5,"e"],["Ps.35.9",4,"w"],["Ps.118.15",4,"w"]]},{"n":6,"t":"Now know I that the LORD saveth his anointed; he will hear him from his holy heaven with the saving strength of his right hand.","x":[["Ps.28.8",11,"e"],["Acts.5.31",4,"w"],["Ps.89.20",4,"w"],["Ps.89.23",4,"r"],["Matt.6.9",3,"r"],["Ps.18.50",3,"w"],["Ps.2.2",3,"w"],["Isa.63.15",3,"w"],["Acts.4.10",3,"r"],["Ps.17.7",2,"w"]]},{"n":7,"t":"Some trust in chariots, and some in horses: but we will remember the name of the LORD our God.","it":[[5,10]],"x":[["Isa.31.1",51,"e"],["Jer.17.5",48,"r"],["Prov.21.31",47,"r"],["Ps.33.16",43,"r"],["Ps.33.17",43,"r"],["2Chr.32.8",32,"r"],["2Chr.14.11",22,"r"],["2Chr.20.12",17,"r"],["2Chr.20.20",17,"r"],["Ps.45.17",11,"r"]]},{"n":8,"t":"They are brought down and fallen: but we are risen, and stand upright.","x":[["Ps.125.1",6,"r"],["Mic.7.8",5,"r"],["Ps.34.21",3,"r"],["Ps.34.22",3,"r"],["Jer.17.7",3,"r"],["Jer.17.8",3,"r"],["Judg.5.31",2,"r"],["Ps.146.5",2,"r"],["Ps.146.9",2,"r"]]},{"n":9,"t":"Save, LORD: let the king hear us when we call.","x":[["Ps.5.2",6,"r"],["Ps.44.4",5,"r"],["Ps.118.25",4,"w"],["Ps.118.26",4,"r"],["Matt.21.15",4,"r"],["Ps.74.12",4,"r"],["Ps.17.6",2,"r"],["Matt.21.9",2,"r"],["Ps.2.6",2,"r"],["Ps.2.10",2,"r"]]}],"title":"To the chief Musician, A Psalm of David."}